# Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# capa_export_gate ships a committed SBOM family under sbom/. The compiler
# emits the SBOMs with LF on every OS, while a checkout with core.autocrlf
# rewrites committed LF to CRLF, so a regenerated file would differ from
# the checked-out one in its line endings alone. Every tracked file is text
# (.capa, .json, .txt, .csv, .md, .toml, .sh, LICENSE, SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH);
# a blanket eol=lf is safe.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Reproducibility inputs, pinned LF for defence in depth.
sbom/SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH text eol=lf
generate.sh            text eol=lf
gate.sh                text eol=lf
